# Validator Alert Component

Provides threshold-based alerting for Ethereum validator monitoring with stateful alert management.

## Key Pattern: Stateful Alert Management
- Implement once-per-incident alerting to prevent notification spam
- Maintain alert state with thread-safe mutex protection
- Clear alert state when conditions return to normal

## Critical Implementation Rules
- Always acquire mutex before accessing or modifying alert state
- Return both shouldAlert flag and specific triggering value for context
- Use allowedSet pattern for efficient validation of allowed values